      "writtenOn": "2024-09-12T20:35:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Out of scope: Assuming a valid Sink Caps message, the behavior being tested for here is probably not what we actually want. Although the PD spec is ambiguous about this, conventionally, including in your sink caps a variable sink PDO with your entire voltage/current range is construed as accepting fixed PDOs in that range. We take advantage of this in our own sink caps. We should probably offer 3A when we can in this situation.",
      "revId": "3e49f287668e4973fa46ae47e49ecc15f76e9056",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
